DragonDen_Shrine_Text_DragonMasterQuestion::
    .string "You traveled through KANTO and\n"
    .string "stood against the ROCKETS here.\p"
    .string "Will you listen to your POKEMON\n"
    .string "and care for them as partners?$"

DragonDen_Shrine_Text_DragonMasterAccepted::
    .string "Your answer honors your partner.\n"
    .string "CLAIR accepts my judgment.\p"
    .string "You earned JOHTO's RISINGBADGE.\n"
    .string "All eight badges are now yours.$"

DragonDen_Shrine_Text_DragonMasterReflect::
    .string "Think about your partner's care.\n"
    .string "Then answer me honestly again.$"

DragonDen_Shrine_Text_DragonMasterBefore::
    .string "First meet CLAIR in the GYM.\n"
    .string "A battle begins this final test.$"

DragonDen_Shrine_Text_DragonMasterAfter::
    .string "DRAGON CLAW is CLAIR's gift.\n"
    .string "Keep your promise to your team.\p"
    .string "The LEAGUE judges your battles.\n"
    .string "Your partner recalls your care.$"

DragonDen_Shrine_Text_DragonMasterFull::
    .string "Your RISINGBADGE is yours.\n"
    .string "Make room for DRAGON CLAW.\p"
    .string "I will keep the TM safe.\n"
    .string "You do not need another battle.$"

